# Fixture: 2H-MoS2 transition-metal-dichalcogenide monolayer (a = 3.16
# Ang, S-Mo-S thickness 3.13 Ang, 15 Ang vacuum on each side), built via
# ase.build.mx2. 2D (one vacuum axis) -- exercises stb-gqca's 2D cell-
# treatment fallback (positions-only relaxation) and the vacuum-aware
# AB-structure enumeration filter. Metal (Mo) sublattice is triangular
# (geometrically frustrated, like FCC), so the AB-ordered representative
# does NOT reach the ideal -1.0 pair correlation exactly -- see
# gqca.py::build_ab_structure's own docstring. --sublattice Mo
# --species-b W builds a Mo(1-x)WxS2 alloy, the suite's concrete target
# system for this workflow.

NumberOfSpecies    2
NumberofAtoms      3

%block ChemicalSpeciesLabel
 1   42   Mo
 2   16   S
%endblock ChemicalSpeciesLabel

LatticeConstant 1.0 Ang

AtomicCoordinatesFormat  Fractional

%block LatticeVectors
 3.16000000   0.00000000   0.00000000
 -1.58000000   2.73664028   0.00000000
 0.00000000   -0.00000000   33.13000000
%endblock LatticeVectors

%block AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
  0.00000000   0.00000000   0.50000000   1
  0.66666667   0.33333333   0.54723815   2
  0.66666667   0.33333333   0.45276185   2
%endblock AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
